<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>中暑门 - 标签 | 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E4%B8%AD%E6%9A%91%E9%97%A8/</link><description>这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。</description><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-alpha-mtcmp1fx</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</webMaster><copyright>本站内容采用 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 国际许可协议。</copyright><lastBuildDate>Thu, 02 Jul 2026 09:25:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E4%B8%AD%E6%9A%91%E9%97%A8/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>中暑门</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/6-3-zhongshumen/</link><pubDate>Thu, 02 Jul 2026 09:20:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/6-3-zhongshumen/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E5%85%AD%E6%95%B0%E9%9B%86/">卷六数集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“中暑门”部分，由&lt;strong&gt;雷公真君&lt;/strong&gt;专论&lt;strong&gt;中暑&lt;/strong&gt;所致亡阳、发狂、神昏、霍乱等危急重症的辨治法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;暑为阳邪，最易耗气伤津、内陷心包。急当补气回阳、清心开窍、解暑化湿，兼顾阴阳虚实。贫者以当归补血汤代独参汤，危者大剂参、膏、蒿并用，并立从治、救产诸法&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item></channel></rss>